WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.736
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
And this is "Late Night."

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:05.171
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:06.305
Now let's get to the news.

00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:08.174
President Biden spoke on
the phone yesterday with

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.642
West Virginia Senator
Joe Manchin,

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:11.844
and they were
able to work out an agreement.

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:15.648
It's now President Manchin
and Senator Biden.

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:19.719
When asked by reporters after
speaking with President Biden

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:21.855
about the $2 trillion
spending bill,

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:23.423
if the measure will
pass this year,

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:25.825
West Virginia Senator
Joe Manchin said,

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:27.626
"Anything's possible here."

00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:28.794
Okay, but to be clear,

00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:30.830
that's not good news.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.565
When someone says,
"Hey, come to my party tonight,

00:00:33.565 --> 00:00:34.867
anything's possible,"

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:38.871
you're leaving in handcuffs
without your pants.

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:42.174
According to newly released
records, Donald Trump Jr.

00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:44.843
texted then-White House
chief of staff Mark Meadows

00:00:44.843 --> 00:00:47.580
during January's Capitol attack,
urging him to make

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.315
President Trump
condemn the violence.

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:51.484
Then he texted again,
saying, "Fine.

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:54.954
I'll tell him myself.
Just give me his number."

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:59.025
The records show that
then-White House chief of staff

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:00.894
Mark Meadows
also received a text from

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:03.429
Fox News host
Brian Kilmeade that said,

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:04.764
"Please get him on TV,

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:06.232
destroying everything
you've accomplished."

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.401
That is a shocking revelation.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:12.806
They had to beg Trump
to go on TV?!

00:01:14.673 --> 00:01:16.643
Fox News host Laura Gr--
Ingraham -- excuse me --

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:18.745
also texted Meadows
during the Capitol attack

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:21.414
and said President Trump needed
to tell the rioters to go home.

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:23.650
Mostly because her show
comes on at 10:00,

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:26.019
and they're her target audience.

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:30.223
It's been a few weeks since
the World Health Organization

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:33.793
designated Omicron as
a new COVID variant of concern,

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:35.194
and it appears to be
rapidly spreading

00:01:35.194 --> 00:01:36.462
around the globe.

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:38.597
But there are still a lot of
uncertainties about

00:01:38.597 --> 00:01:39.999
how dangerous it is.

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.235
So let's take a look at
what we know so far

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:45.738
in a segment called "Getting to
Know the Omicron Variant."

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.774
♪♪

00:02:44.863 --> 00:02:46.332 line:0%
And, finally...

00:02:49.535 --> 00:02:52.538
This has been "Getting to Know
the Omicron Variant."

00:02:52.538 --> 00:02:54.573
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:55.507 --> 00:02:59.245
According to a new study, rocket
scientists and brain surgeons

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:01.280
are not smarter than the
general public.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:04.050
The study consisted of
two photographs.

00:03:05.284 --> 00:03:08.321
During yesterday's White House
press briefing,

00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:10.122
Fox News reporter Peter Doocy

00:03:10.122 --> 00:03:12.591
said that the recent
Christmas-tree fire outside of

00:03:12.591 --> 00:03:14.427
the network's
New York office caused a

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:16.496
half-million dollars
worth of damage.

00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:20.733
That tree cost Fox News
half-a-million dollars?

00:03:20.733 --> 00:03:24.137
Did they decorate it
or sexually harass it?

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:28.274
And, finally,
according to the latest numbers,

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:30.443
Apple is set to become
the world's first company

00:03:30.443 --> 00:03:33.145
with a market value
of more than $3 trillion.

00:03:33.145 --> 00:03:35.414
And almost $2 trillion
of that comes from

00:03:35.414 --> 00:03:37.951
chargers left in hotel rooms.

00:03:37.951 --> 00:03:39.419
And that was
a monologue, everybody.

